description: Git commit authorship — never add Cursor as co-author
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any other Cursor/agent co-author trailer to a commit message. The commit author is the user only.

If a hook or wrapper appends that trailer, strip it before finishing (amend the just-created HEAD commit if it has not been pushed).
